Description: Implements cross-validation and bootstrap methods to detect and correct for overfitting in meta-regression. Provides optimism-corrected R-squared measures, bootstrap confidence intervals, and diagnostic tools for assessing the reliability of heterogeneity explanations in meta-analysis.
